/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Brief definition Advance Care Planning \(ACP\) is defined as the ability to enable individuals to define goals and preferences for future medical treatment and care, to discuss these goals and preferences with family and health-care providers, and to record and review these preferences if appropriate.)
